+# White-label checklist
+
+Replace **HUNTER** / **HUNTER Intelligence** with the licensee's brand. Test in browser + one test email after changes.
+
+## Environment (required)
+
+| Variable | Example | Used for |
+|----------|---------|----------|
+| `OPERATOR_BRAND` | `Acme Ops Intelligence` | Email sign-off, seed outreach bodies |
+| `RESEND_FROM` | `Acme Ops <hello@acmeops.com>` | Outbound email |
+| `BOOKING_URL` | Cal.com / Calendly link | Landing, outreach, CRM |
+| `PUBLIC_URL` | `https://pipeline.acmeops.com` | Webhooks, links in n8n |
+
+Copy from `operator-license-kit/config/brand.env.example` into `.env`.
+
+## Files to edit (brand strings)
+
+| File | What to change |
+|------|----------------|
+| `frontend/index.html` | Logo text, hero, footer, meta title/description |
+| `frontend/operator.html` | Title, greeting label if hardcoded |
+| `frontend/hunter_crm.html` | Header product name (optional rename file) |
+| `content/give-before-ask/*.html` | Footer line "HUNTER Intelligence" |
+| `content/give-before-ask/index.html` | Title + footer |
+| `content/linkedin-post-001.md` | Sign-off / DM CTA (if they use as-is) |
+| `lib/outreach-engine.js` | Default `RESEND_FROM` fallback string |
+| `lib/proposal-engine.js` | "HUNTER Intelligence" in system prompts |
+| `lib/spark-import.js` | Default email sign-off |
+| `templates/msa-template.md` | Provider legal name |
+| `templates/sow-template.md` | Provider name in header |
+| `business/*.md` | Positioning (optional—often kept as internal reference) |
+| `package.json` | `name` / `description` (cosmetic) |
+
+## Optional rename (advanced)
+
+| Item | Note |
+|------|------|
+| Repo / Railway service name | Operator's choice |
+| `hunter_crm.html` → `crm.html` | Update nav links in all HTML |
+| Domain path `/content/give-before-ask/` | Can stay; only customer-facing PDFs matter |
+
+## Do **not** white-label without lawyer review
+
+- `templates/msa-template.md` — governing law, liability caps
+- `templates/sow-template.md` — payment terms
+- `LICENSE_TERMS_TEMPLATE.md` — your license to **them**
+
+## Verify after white-label
+
+```bash
+npm run verify-launch
+npm start
+npm run seed
+npm run health
+```
+
+Open landing + CRM; send one `POST /api/outreach/send` with `dryRun` or Resend test mode.
